{"ref":"BDB, אָכֵן","hw":"אָכֵן","html":"† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">אָכֵן</span></big></big>  <strong>(</strong>perh. from <span dir=\"rtl\">אַךְ</span>; cf. Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">דֵּךְ</span> & <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּכֵּן</span><strong>) adv.</strong> with strong asseverative force:<br><strong>a.</strong>  <strong> surely</strong>, truly, especially at beginning of a speech (stronger & more decided than <span dir=\"rtl\">אַךְ</span>) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 28:16\" href=\"/Genesis.28.16\">Gn 28:16</a> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 2:14\" href=\"/Exodus.2.14\">Ex 2:14</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 15:32\" href=\"/I_Samuel.15.32\">1 S 15:32</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 40:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.40.7\">Is 40:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 45:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.45.15\">45:15</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:23\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.23\">Je 3:23</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 4:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.4.10\">4:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 8:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.8.8\">8:8</a>. In <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:2\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.2\">1 K 11:2</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">אָכֵן</span> stands unusually; and <span dir=\"rtl\">פֶּן־</span> (cf. 𝔊 𝔖 𝔗 should prob. be read (so Klo).<br><strong>b.</strong>  emphasizing a contrast, <em>but indeed, but in fact</em>, especially after <span dir=\"rtl\">אָמַרְתִּי</span> <em>I said</em> or <em>thought</em>, expressing the reality, in opp. to what had been wrongly imagined, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 49:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.49.4\">Is 49:4b</a> (opp. to v <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 49:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.49.4\">4a</a>) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 53:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.53.4\">53:4</a> (opp. to v <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 53:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.53.3\">3</a> end) <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:20\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.20\">Je 3:20</a> (opp. to the expectation v <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.19\">19b</a>) <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 3:7\" href=\"/Zephaniah.3.7\">Zp 3:7b</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 31:23\" href=\"/Psalms.31.23\">ψ 31:23b</a> (opp. to v <a data-ref=\"Psalms 31:23\" href=\"/Psalms.31.23\">23a</a>) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 66:19\" href=\"/Psalms.66.19\">66:19</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 82:7\" href=\"/Psalms.82.7\">82:7</a> (opp. to v <a data-ref=\"Psalms 82:6\" href=\"/Psalms.82.6\">6</a>) <a data-ref=\"Job 32:8\" href=\"/Job.32.8\">Jb 32:8</a> (opp. to v <a data-ref=\"Job 32:7\" href=\"/Job.32.7\">7</a>).","next":"BDB, אָכַף","prev":"BDB, מַכֹּ֫לֶת"}